  "name": "Copycat Arby\u2019s Horsey Sauce",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "Whip up this copycat Arby's Horsey Sauce at home in no time. Cool, creamy, and assertively tangy, this sauce delivers a sharp horseradish kick that blooms through rich mayonnaise. Zippy and smooth, it has just enough heat to wake up roast beef, fries, or a sandwich spread.",
  "cuisine": "Copycat",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Whisk together mayonnaise, horseradish, vinegar, mustard powder, sugar, and salt together in a bowl until smooth. Serve immediately, or store, covered, in the refrigerator for up to 5 days. Recipe deveolped by Marianne Williams"
    }
  ],
